# Firmware background IK: pose -> joint angles (SDK Arm::ik).
#
# seed is optional and always seven values: the solver runs on the 7-axis model even
# on a bench unit, and empty means "derive a seed from the measured position". This
# one solves; it does not move the arm, and is available without allow_motion.

float64[6] pose
float64[] seed
float64 timeout
---
bool success
string message
float64[] q
